petrus-sqlite
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package supports the Haskell port of Petrus (see UPSTREAM.md at the
repository root). It is the SQLite layer the SQLite stores share: the
connection profiles, DDL text and writer fence of the pinned reference,
which drives SQLite through CPython 3.14's sqlite3 module; its test suite
compares the two.

